{"verse": {"id": 2176185, "chapter_id": 4728, "verse_number": "९१", "content_sanskrit": "स तैः सम्पूजितः सर्वैः सम्प्रहृष्टतनूरुहः\t॥९१॥", "padaccheda": "", "anvaya": "", "meaning_sanskrit": "", "meaning_english": "", "audio_url": null, "display_order": 106}, "commentaries": [{"id": 1, "verse_id": 2176185, "commentary_type": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "author": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "lang": "kn", "content": "ಅವರು ದುರ್ಯೋಧನನನ್ನು ಪೂಜಿಸಿದಾಗ ಅವನು ಸಂತೋಷದಿಂದ ರೋಮಾಂಚನವನ್ನು ಹೊಂದಿದನು."}]}